{"id": "q0104", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "conservative", "tier": "conservative", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2916162406, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "1bd884090589f25ac8e99f9bb754f4b90b4c7a09d6887616d0aefbdba25a74d4", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.9057239890098572, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 6, "query": "Let $n$ be a positive integer.  What is the greatest possible value of $\\gcd(n + 7, 2n + 1)$?\n\nSolve and give the final answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0104.wav", "input_sha256": "c27f56e90b9422f9d1e855d81785113269e96879ee57f4e1d7705a9c61a2fa04", "input_samples": 130600, "input_s": 8.162, "n_real_chunks": 9, "score": 0.955, "act": 0.9984, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "The greatest possible value is 13. Since \\[ \\gcd(n+7,2n+1) \\] must divide any integer linear combination: \\[ 2(n+7)-(2n+1)=13 \\] So the gcd can be at most 13. This value is achieved when \\(n=6\\): \\[ n+7=13,\\quad 2n+1=13 \\] Thus, \\[ \\gcd(13,13)=13 \\] Final answer: \\(\\boxed{13}\\)", "expert_answer": "The greatest possible value is **13**.\n\nSince  \n\\[\n\\gcd(n+7,2n+1)\n\\]\nmust divide any integer linear combination:\n\n\\[\n2(n+7)-(2n+1)=13\n\\]\n\nSo the gcd can be at most **13**. This value is achieved when \\(n=6\\):\n\n\\[\nn+7=13,\\quad 2n+1=13\n\\]\n\nThus,\n\n\\[\n\\gcd(13,13)=13\n\\]\n\n**Final answer: \\(\\boxed{13}\\)**", "transcript": "Let n dollars be a positive integer. What is the greatest possible value of gcd n plus 7, 2n plus 1? Solve and give the final answer.\n", "asr_s": 0.92, "expert_s": 4.67, "expert_input_samples": 130600, "expert_input_s": 8.162, "expert_input_sha256": "c27f56e90b9422f9d1e855d81785113269e96879ee57f4e1d7705a9c61a2fa04", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 0.0, "relay_synth_ms": 30367, "onset_chunk": 8, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 60, "feed_lag_max_ms": 1380, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 26122, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0104_conservative_relay.wav", "sha256": "0f309236b8f73cc89284daa23849c3d561382785f543c972b6e59a689d3c07d2", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 47.32}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0104_conservative_candidate.wav", "sha256": "d64952b4cf3f3b6b869f01fa116b6860b0e910a88bdfaa76fa93313b8b9dcfe2", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0104_conservative_stall.wav", "sha256": "bb62618b5d4b4137d902040d67e0ba569611d973f49f22726601a91d350205af", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 61.0}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.085, 1.155, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.075, 2.132, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.091, 3.162, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 4.0, 4.092, 4.164, 1, 0, 0], [4, 1, 5.0, 5.088, 5.158, 1, 0, 0], [5, 1, 6.0, 6.078, 6.143, 1, 0, 0], [6, 1, 7.0, 7.077, 7.141, 1, 0, 0], [7, 1, 8.0, 8.094, 8.168, 1, 0, 0], [8, 1, 8.162, 8.254, 9.161, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.162, 10.614, 11.456, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 10.162, 11.529, 12.309, 0, 24000, 0], [11, 0, 11.162, 12.401, 13.249, 0, 24000, 0], [12, 0, 12.162, 13.337, 14.115, 0, 24000, 0], [13, 0, 13.162, 14.203, 15.159, 0, 24000, 0], [14, 0, 14.162, 15.247, 16.14, 0, 24000, 0], [15, 0, 15.162, 16.229, 16.944, 0, 24000, 0], [16, 0, 16.163, 17.021, 17.747, 0, 24000, 0], [17, 0, 17.163, 17.828, 18.578, 0, 24000, 0], [18, 0, 18.163, 18.655, 19.383, 0, 24000, 0], [19, 0, 19.163, 19.458, 20.277, 0, 24000, 0], [20, 0, 20.163, 20.359, 21.117, 0, 24000, 0], [21, 0, 21.163, 21.256, 22.008, 0, 24000, 0], [22, 0, 22.163, 22.258, 23.228, 0, 24000, 0], [23, 0, 23.163, 23.315, 24.141, 0, 24000, 0], [24, 0, 24.163, 24.26, 25.064, 0, 24000, 0], [25, 0, 25.163, 25.257, 26.124, 0, 24000, 0], [26, 0, 26.163, 26.248, 27.038, 0, 24000, 0], [27, 0, 27.163, 27.259, 28.19, 0, 24000, 0], [28, 0, 28.163, 28.285, 29.19, 0, 24000, 0], [29, 0, 29.163, 29.28, 30.275, 0, 24000, 0], [30, 0, 30.163, 30.365, 31.215, 0, 24000,