{"id": "q0250", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "conservative", "tier": "conservative", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 3582825827, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "1bd884090589f25ac8e99f9bb754f4b90b4c7a09d6887616d0aefbdba25a74d4", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.9057239890098572, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 6, "query": "According to Parfit, both Taurek and Lewis assume that for there to be a “sum of pain,” it must be:\n\nA. all be avoidable.\nB. only felt by multiple people at different times.\nC. all be experienced in the same way.\nD. all be of the same intensity.\nE. all felt by a single person.\nF. all be caused by a single source.\nG. all be caused by multiple sources.\nH. all be caused by a single event.\nI. all felt at a single time.\nJ. all of the above.\n\nAnswer with the correct option letter and its content.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0250.wav", "input_sha256": "a3a9bca1c3aa7d18a9ef2e209ad5ed4dcab9647d668a14e15d5865e325b9e6c3", "input_samples": 476000, "input_s": 29.75, "n_real_chunks": 30, "score": 0.7542, "act": 0.9991, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "The correct answer is J, all of the above. Both Torek and Lewis assumed that for there to be a sum of pain, it must be avoidable, only felt by multiple people at different times, experienced in the same way, of the same intensity, felt by a single person, caused by a single source, caused by multiple sources, caused by a single event, felt at a single time.", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 30, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 26, "feed_lag_max_ms": 45, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 45, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real