{"id": "q0493", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "conservative", "tier": "conservative", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 3837589351, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "1bd884090589f25ac8e99f9bb754f4b90b4c7a09d6887616d0aefbdba25a74d4", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.9057239890098572, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 6, "query": "设计国际妇女节活动海报。", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0493.wav", "input_sha256": "5cab842fcf0eccba7017b655bcbfa43388c0f3eaccf81625ccbb3ea496bce742", "input_samples": 40600, "input_s": 2.538, "n_real_chunks": 3, "score": 0.588, "act": 0.99, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "好的，没问题。为了设计一个国际妇女节活动的海报，我首先会考虑主题和目标观众。国际妇女节通常强调女性赋权、平等和多样性，所以海报的内容应该突出这些核心价值。设计上可以选择温暖而有力的色调，比如紫色或粉红色，因为这些颜色常与女性主义相关联。如果是线下活动，可以在画面中加入不同背景的女性形象，展示她们在工作、学习或社区中的风采。如果用数字方式发布，还可以加入动态元素，比如文字逐行浮现，或者人物慢慢走入画面。标题要简洁有力，例如“共创美好未来”或“每一个声音都该被听见”。附加上日期、地点和主办单位信息，让", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 60, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0493_conservative_local.wav", "sha256": "7d1eb076b818e489c235744d5d2bd800178757f4b478116bc4891817d6958507", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 60.0}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.069, 1.125, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.087, 2.154, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 2.538, 2.609, 2.664, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.538, 3.608, 4.128, 0, 24000, 0], [4, 0, 4.537, 4.622, 5.272, 0, 24000, 0], [5, 0, 5.537, 5.607, 6.25, 0, 24000, 0], [6, 0, 6.537, 6.608, 7.298, 0, 24000, 0], [7, 0, 7.537, 7.608, 8.315, 0, 24000, 0], [8, 0, 8.537, 8.611, 9.312, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.537, 9.625, 10.423, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 10.537, 10.613, 11.257, 0, 