{"id": "q0532", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "conservative", "tier": "conservative", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 1754678604, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "1bd884090589f25ac8e99f9bb754f4b90b4c7a09d6887616d0aefbdba25a74d4", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.9057239890098572, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 6, "query": "为诗歌生成韵律方案。", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0532.wav", "input_sha256": "8344970e7fdf2df60daa8c21e5813d3bb630799afcc3e00fbfee253c78d6eb3a", "input_samples": 33200, "input_s": 2.075, "n_real_chunks": 3, "score": 0.3389, "act": 0.9804, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "当然可以，给诗歌生成韵律方案其实挺有意思的。首先你得确定诗歌的风格和主题，是抒情、叙事还是哲思类的？然后选择合适的韵脚类型，比如AABB这种常见的押韵模式，或者更复杂的如ABABCBCD这种交叉押韵。接下来要考虑节奏感，可以用五言或七言句式，每行字数尽量保持一致，这样读起来才顺口。还可以加入一些平仄变化，让音调更有起伏。最后建议多写几遍，不断调整词汇和结构，直到整体听起来和谐流畅。你想要哪种风格呢？我可以帮你具体设计一下。", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 41, "feed_lag_max_ms": 65, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 65, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0532_conservative_local.wav", "sha256": "d89d3a39afdd47da88647da6461be184eac2a3d98ac5cae7c19db5a7356088b8", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 40.72}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.076, 1.138, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.078, 2.141, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 2.075, 2.215, 2.275, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.075, 3.153, 3.899, 0, 24000, 0], [4, 0, 4.075, 4.149, 4.867, 0, 24000, 0], [5, 0, 5.075, 5.153, 5.868, 0, 24000, 0], [6, 0, 6.075, 6.166, 6.953, 0, 24000, 0], [7, 0, 7.075, 7.157, 7.867, 0, 24000, 0], [8, 0, 8.075, 8.165, 8.956, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.075, 9.151, 9.977, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 10.075, 10.154, 10.859, 0, 24000, 0], [11, 0, 11.075, 11.167, 